3dly. Many names occur in these verses, such as Delaiah, Pelaiah, Rephaiah, Pedaiah, or Pheraiah, which very nearly resemble each other, not only in the sound, but also in their constituent letters. This very similitude is a ground of suspicion, as in such names it was impossible to prevent confusion. 

